  "_comment": [
    "State/jurisdiction rollout registry — mirrors language-config.json.",
    "A jurisdiction is selectable in the UI only when enabled: true, which",
    "happens ONLY via `npm run onboard-state <Name> <source-doc>` after the",
    "real state Act text has been ingested and its seed validation passes.",
    "",
    "INTEGRITY RULE: each state's legal text must come from that state's",
    "REAL Cooperative Societies Act (official source). Placeholder or",
    "AI-generated law text is a serious integrity violation for a legal",
    "tool and is never generated. act_name is filled only where the Act's",
    "official name/year is known; null means 'confirm from the source",
    "document during onboarding'."
  ],
